00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.370
You're being awfully rough.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:08.540
If I were a masochist, I'd be over the moon.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.790
I've heard the rumors about you, Miss Yuyu.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:14.450
Armed with your Rare Skill, Lunatic Trancer,

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:19.370
