00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.040
I...

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:32.750
I'm behind everyone else,

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.790
so I have to do this.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:39.620
So please, let me keep going.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.620
