anything about Miss Yuyu.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.080
You're Miss Yuyu's Schild, right?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.120
I can't believe you actually snagged her.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.910
Congratulations, Riri.

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:24.370
Everyone from Alfheim?!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.950
Perfect timing.

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:29.330
Would you tell us about Miss Yuyu?

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:32.790
Well, we were in different
buildings for junior high.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.830
But when it comes to Miss Yuyu...

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.620
The evacuation of Koshu.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.000
Koshu?

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:47.950
The battle two years ago, when most
of Koshu fell to a massive Huge attack?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:53.370
Several legions from Yurigaoka
engaged them but suffered heavy losses.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:58.700
It's what caused the powerful
previous-generation Alfheim to disband.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:03.120
The upperclassmen don't like to talk about it.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.950
You must have guts to ask them.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:11.500
Miss Yuyu, who was a junior-high
third-year, was allowed to participate.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.370
Then you must also know

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:17.950
that Miss Yuyu lost her Schutzengel there.

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:25.330
You were awfully rough on that new girl, Yuyu.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.950
