00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.910
I can't help it.

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:31.700
Aren't you afraid she'll hate you?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:35.120
I really... wouldn't mind.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:38.950
You're really scared of
that new girl, aren't you?

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.040
So, you try to push her away.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.450
You're afraid to accept her.

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:45.200
That's not...

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.000
I just...

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.250
Sorry.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.950
Look over there.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:59.750
The Yoshino cherries bloomed again this year.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.540
"First year"
"Miriam Hildegard von Gropius"

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:13.160
