00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.830
She finally channeled her Magie.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.500
That's enough for to--

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:58.370
We're going.

00:09:58.370 --> 00:09:59.950
Right!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.830
Umm, where?

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:05.330
We're on duty today, aren't we?

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.950
Oh, yes!

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:10.330
But first...

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.500
Umm,

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:20.410
do we have time for this right now?

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:23.500
A Lily from Yurigaoka Girls' Academy

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:30.290
must never look so slovenly on
the battlefield. It sets a bad example.

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:33.870
Th-That hurts, Miss Yuyu.

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:37.160
I'm not used to doing this either.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.500
I think we have some time
before it makes landfall.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:46.290
Are you sortieing, too, Kaede?

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:52.450
We're a group of freelance Lilies who
haven't joined legions yet this time.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:55.040
It's a common sight this time of year.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.620
Then you, too, Fumi?

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.580
She'll be watching from the sidelines.

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:01.750
She has no combat experience.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:04.330
Good luck, everybody.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.830
You'll be the only first-timer, Riri.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:08.580
O-Okay. I'll do my best.

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.500
You stay here, too.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.540
You'll be in the way.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.450
Watch from here.

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:19.290
Miss Yuyu.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.910
I wish she'd make up her mind.

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:41.450
This Huge looks even more twisted than usual.

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.040
It jumped?!

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.910
This Huge is a Restore.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.160
"Arsenal Division second year"
"Mashima Moyu"

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.370
"Arsenal Division second year"
"Mashima Moyu"

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.370
Looks like a Restore.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:05.620
Looks like a Restore.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.160
I hear they've been appearing
more frequently of late.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:12.250
Oh, Miss Moyu and Miriam.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:14.080
Why are you here?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.790
What's a "Restore"?

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:20.830
We may be in Arsenal Division,
but we're still Lilies.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.910
We can hold our own in a fight.

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:25.620
Although we're not on duty today.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:32.330
So, Huge that sustain damage and
survive return to a nest for repairs.

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:36.160
We call them "Restored" or "Restores."

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:41.540
They've survived multiple battles,
so they're no pushovers.

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.620
Miss Yuyu is amazing.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.000
But she's placing herself in jeopardy.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:50.500
She's incredibly skilled,
but she's charging too far ahead.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.660
Those are...

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:04.950
Fall back already, Yuyu!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.500
What the--

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:31.200
"First year"       "First year"
"Wang Yujia"      "Kuo Shenlin"

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.660
"First year"       "First year"
"Wang Yujia"      "Kuo Shenlin"

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.660
So many CHARMS...

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:33.450
"First year"       "First year"
"Wang Yujia"      "Kuo Shenlin"

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:33.450
What?

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.160
What?

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.540
Then...

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.290
How many Lilies has this thing...?

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:45.620
Seriously?

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.750
Wh-What's wrong?

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:50.950
A Lily's CHARM is a part of her body.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:53.540
She'd only let it go if...

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.500
That's enough!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.160
Fall back, Yuyu!

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:28.580
Miss Yuyu!

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.200
Wait, Yujia!

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.120
Huh?

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.500
That's...

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.540
Lunatic Trancer.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:41.080
Once a Lily enters that trance,
she loses all sense of reason

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:47.200
and continues to destroy friend and
foe alike until her Magie is exhausted.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.660
It's a Skill Yuyu herself sealed away.

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.950
Then why unleash it now?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:56.950
All those CHARMs that lost their
owners must have made her remember.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:58.750
You mean...

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:03.450
Yuyu lost her own Schutzengel
when she was in junior high.

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:09.080
Because Yuyu had activated
Lunatic Trancer at the time,

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:11.410
suspicion fell on her.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:12.870
That's horrible.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:18.410
I hear there were actually cuts
inflicted by Yuyu's CHARM on the body.

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:22.250
In the end, she was cleared
due to lack of evidence,

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.910
but Yuyu's own memories are hazy.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:28.950
She's been blaming herself ever since.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.250
I'm going to go to her.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.160
No! Yuyu is dangerous right now!

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:46.200
I think I understand
Miss Yuyu a little better now.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:50.160
That's not an answer!

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:52.160
Whoops.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.290
Yuyu!

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:12.080
Misuzu?

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:29.790
H-How dare you do that to my sister?!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:34.410
Miss Yuyu!

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.790
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.580
Don't look.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.830
Riri! What are you doing?

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.910
Are you stupid?

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:01.830
I felt Miss Yuyu just now.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.200
What do you mean?

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.790
It's Magie.

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:10.620
Riri and Yuyu's Magie
touched through their CHARMs.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:14.870
I've never heard of anyone
using a CHARM that way.

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:17.120
But it is conceivable.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:23.450
Miss Yuyu saved me once before.

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:27.410
Now I have to save her!

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.910
Are you insane?!

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:35.750
You have to let me wash your back later!

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:37.620
Guess I've got no choice.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:40.000
Shall we join in, Yujia?

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.080
Y-Yeah.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.160
Maybe I should have brought my CHARM, too.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:47.370
I ought to be out there with them!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.410
Miss Yuyu!

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:59.500
Didn't you tell me that we
always have to look our best?!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:07.450
Look at me, Miss Yuyu!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:20.660
Is that...?

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.790
A Magie sphere.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:27.410
You must be disappointed, Riri.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.290
This is who I am.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.870
Just an ugly, despicable
monster consumed by hatred.

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:38.250
Even if that's true, you're still my sister!

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:40.160
Miss Yuyu!

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:45.120
Riri.

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:56.790
We're going to jump, Riri.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:00.950
Right, Yuyu!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:19.370
We're riding on Magie.

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:22.410
Riri, we'll do this together.

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.950
Yes!

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:42.830
Nice going, Yuyu.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:55.700
Yoshino cherries need the
cold of winter to bloom.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:20:02.080
I'm told they used to bloom when spring came,
marking the change of seasons.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:05.910
But the line between winter
and spring is blurred now.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:09.870
They must be confused about when to bloom.

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:24.370
This is your Schutzengel, Miss Yuyu?

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:28.000
Yes. My big sister.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.370
Kawazoe... Misuzu.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:54.000
Yuyu!

00:20:55.950 --> 00:21:01.410
Honestly, you're so reckless.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:04.830
Misuzu.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.160
Don't overdo it.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.580
That power of yours

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:13.160
will end up destroying you, too.

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:24.500
Don't worry, Yuyu.

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:29.580
This is our destiny.

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.830
Misuzu.

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:42.250
I'll hold on to this CHARM.

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:00.620
I'm back.

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:01.410
You're in the dark again.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:02.750
"Student council, second year"
"Hata Matsuri"

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:02.750
You're in the dark again.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:05.200
"Student council, second year"
"Hata Matsuri"

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:05.200
You'll ruin your eyesight.

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:09.040
You sortied today, right?

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:11.410
Good work.

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:13.330
Thank you, Matsuri.

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:17.290
I think... I managed to carry myself well.

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:21.290
Did you just say, "Thank you"?

00:22:21.290 --> 00:22:23.410
Say it again.

00:22:23.410 --> 00:22:24.500
Why?

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:29.290
Because I don't know when
I last saw you be this nice.

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:33.000
What? I'm the same as always.

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:37.000
"To be continued"

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:07.410
"Next time"
"Episode 4"

00:24:07.410 --> 00:24:09.540
"Next time"
"Episode 4"

00:24:07.410 --> 00:24:09.540
Next time, Riri forms a legion!

00:24:09.540 --> 00:24:12.000
"Next time"
"Episode 4"

00:24:09.540 --> 00:24:12.000
I'll do my best for my big sister!

00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:16.910
"Illustration: Fuzichoco"
